-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#3dff8f]\",\"children\":[\"REV \",2,\" / \",\"VERIFIED\",\" \",\"2026-08-27\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"hidden items-center justify-center border-x border-white/10 text-[#f4d431] lg:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L23\",null,{\"iconNode\":\"$c:props:children:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:children:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/15 py-7 lg:border-t-0 lg:pl-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#78858a]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L23\",null,{\"iconNode\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2\",\"key\":\"8i5ue5\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2\",\"key\":\"1b9ql8\"}],[\"line\",{\"x1\":\"8\",\"x2\":\"16\",\"y1\":\"12\",\"y2\":\"12\",\"key\":\"1jonct\"}]],\"className\":\"lucide-link2 lucide-link-2 h-4 w-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\" \",\"EVIDENCE AND REPRODUCTION\"]}],\"$L26\"]}]]}]]}]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[#080a0c]\",\"children\":[null,\"\\n\",[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"journey\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 border-b border-white/12 px-5 py-20 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":\"01 / Journey\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-5 block h-px w-16 bg-[#24e0ff]\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] text-white md:text-6xl\",\"children\":\"Presentation should naturally become booking.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"cstd-mdx-prose cstd-mdx-prose-dark\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The homepage is not a pile of images. It guides visitors from style and service understanding into availability, booking, and recovery, while admin and customer accounts share one booking truth.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Photography sites have an easy trap: build a beautiful gallery and leave visitors without a natural next step. I treated service explanation, visual style, availability, and booking state as four points in one journey. Someone can begin with a photograph or with a date; both routes return to the same service truth.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"That means the copy and interaction need fewer invitations to “explore” and more direct answers: what the session is, who it suits, what to prepare, and what happens after submission. The first frame earns attention; a clear path earns the booking.\"}]]}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"experience\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 border-b border-white/12 px-5 py-20 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":\"02 / Experience\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-5 block h-px w-16 bg-[#24e0ff]\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] text-white md:text-6xl\",\"children\":\"3D atmosphere must not block the photographs.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"cstd-mdx-prose cstd-mdx-prose-dark\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The immersive layer stays in one isolated canvas, imagery is responsive, and the PWA restores interrupted booking. Motion supports the brand without replacing the work.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The photographs sit in front of the visual layer, while 3D and transitions add a sense of space. On a slow network, a modest device, or a calm-motion setting, the work remains the main subject. The form also avoids one fragile long request: local state keeps unfinished input, and recovery rechecks availability.\"}]]}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"release\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 border-b border-white/12 px-5 py-20 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":\"03 / Release\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-5 block h-px w-16 bg-[#24e0ff]\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] text-white md:text-6xl\",\"children\":\"Release gates cover the whole booking story.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"cstd-mdx-prose cstd-mdx-prose-dark\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Static checks, unit tests, build budgets, and Playwright jointly verify pages, APIs, service workers, and the critical booking flow.\"}],\"$L27\"]}]]}]]}]}]]]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b border-[#f4d431]/40 bg-[#f4d431] px-5 py-20 text-[#050709] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L23\",null,{\"iconNode\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a